 "kind": "definition",
 "title": "The derived category of $\\mathcal{O}_X$-modules",
 "statement": "Let $X$ be a scheme. Apply the\nderived-category construction\nto the abelian category of sheaves of $\\mathcal O_X$-modules; denote\nthe result by $D(\\mathcal O_X)$. The category\n$D_{\\mathrm{QCoh}}(\\mathcal O_X)$ is the full subcategory consisting\nof objects whose cohomology sheaves are quasi-coherent.",
